  "bundle": [
    {
      "path": "cordis.patch.yml",
      "text": "# dsh-pack-plugin bundle patch：插入 host 插件。\n# host 面（`exports[\".\"]`）是 cordis 插件\n#   `{ name: \"dspack-host\", inject: [\"connection\", \"webServer\"], apply }`：\n#   inject webServer 后在 webServer 上挂 /dsh-pack 前缀路由 → 设置面板 UI 的静默直连\n#   RPC（纯 UI + 后端，无 AI 面）。connection 用于复用 Host/Origin + 浏览器鉴权栅栏。\n- insert:\n    - id: dspack-host\n      name: '@dsh-packforge/dsh-pack-plugin'\n      inject: [connection, webServer, skills]\n"
    }
  ],
